    {
      "section": "论起玉堂天乙贵人",
      "text": "论起玉堂天乙贵人",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c024:p0002",
      "sha256": "6c0e075891c6211acec74fe64d60be758d6840b0161cc6b34c4c56462cc467f8"
    },
    {
      "section": "论起玉堂天乙贵人",
      "text": "甲戊兼牛羊，乙己鼠猴乡，丙丁猪鸡位，壬癸兔蛇藏，",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c024:p0003",
      "sha256": "fe653ca7455da5ebf36225832db5d91a6db11fbde89b8ee2872a1295a13b0bd7"
    },
    {
      "section": "论起玉堂天乙贵人",
      "text": "庚辛逢马虎，此是贵人方，命中如遇此，定作紫薇郎。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c024:p0004",
      "sha256": "affabb4e59bc82652181acc8a963d021571b11fa6a9d0cab82daf5ce99eccdcf"
    },
    {
      "section": "论起玉堂天乙贵人",
      "text": "十干临十支皆贵人所临之方，惟辰戌二宫贵人不临，殊不知辰戌乃魁罡恶曜之地，天乙不临，所以不为贵也。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c024:p0005",
      "sha256": "1d5a3bf095852dd8e3ac25ffeca0a48079446333210607e4705df2bcc91a466b"
    },
    {
      "section": "论起玉堂天乙贵人",
      "text": "眉批：言本乃主天之神而曰天乙，临之方有恶煞相浑，或落空亡之地，不为贵也。",
      "layer": "historical_commentary",
      "commentary_spans": [
